    <Description>use 220 speed on a horizontal farm yaw 90/0 and pitch 28 its a 1 by 5 plots pumpkin farm 

it should be water then 4 dirt blocks on which you should plant your pumpkins and repeat it with slabs over the water and at the end it should have a block in the water on which you would continue on the next row on which at the start you should have a block on top of the first pumpkin with a trapdoor facing you and do that for every row till the end 

you should set your "/setspawn" at the start of the farm at exactly "yaw 90/0 and pitch 28" have your tool in the 1st slot of your hotbar then start the macro.
and you are going to start farming leftwards "A" then you would go frondwards "W" and then continue right "D"</Description>
